# {{project_name}}

Tessera plugin crate.

## Usage

Add the plugin to your Tessera app:

```toml
[dependencies]
{{project_name}} = { path = "{{project_name}}" }
```

Register it in your entrypoint:

```rust
use tessera_ui::EntryPoint;

#[tessera_ui::entry]
pub fn run() -> EntryPoint {
    EntryPoint::new(app).plugin({{project_name_snake}}::HelloPlugin::default())
}
```

Use it from components or app code:

```rust
if let Some(message) = {{project_name_snake}}::message() {
    println!("{message}");
}
```

## Build

```bash
cargo build
```
